+  Messages:
+  2->1 MsgAppResp Term:1 Log:0/3 Rejected (Hint: 0)
+> 1 receiving messages
+  2->1 MsgAppResp Term:1 Log:0/3 Rejected (Hint: 0)
+  DEBUG 1 received MsgAppResp(MsgApp was rejected, lastindex: 0) from 2 for index 3
