+----
+INFO 1 ignoring conf change {ConfChangeTransitionAuto [{ConfChangeAddNode 3 []} {ConfChangeAddNode 4 []} {ConfChangeAddNode 5 []}] [] []} at config voters=(1 2)&&(1): must transition out of joint config first
